📌 **Tips for your video recording:**
1. Start by showing the **Native App Icon** on your phone's home screen.
2. Tap it and show the dark **Splash Screen** loading instantly.
3. Show the **Camera scanning** process in real-time.
4. Show the **Review Grid** where you can tap to fix/verify colors (emphasize that this part is 100% Native Blade!).
5. Finally, hit "Solve" and show off the **interactive 3D cube** (drag it around with your finger to show off the OrbitControls, and hit "Next/Prev" to show the move instructions at the bottom!).
